{"unit_id":"GiantAxeint__DSH-P2M#card-zh","repo":"GiantAxeint/DSH-P2M","commit":"054020474a879b93fb9b8b27a84137fafec47722","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH-P2M 是面向 DSH 的插件管理器，通过 Cordis loader 入口接入，并在后台检查运行状态与补丁配置。它可发现插件冲突、记录插件使用时长、按使用情况排列优先级，并持久化启用或隔离决策；恢复插件前还可先行试跑。适合需要管理多个 DSH 插件并追踪冲突的用户，使用时需要 DSH 和 Node.js 18 或更高版本。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:7-8","lib/index.js:410-476","lib/priority.js:52-60"]}
{"unit_id":"GiantAxeint__DSH-P2M#card-en","repo":"GiantAxeint/DSH-P2M","commit":"054020474a879b93fb9b8b27a84137fafec47722","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH-P2M manages DSH plugins through a Cordis loader entry. It scans conflicts, tracks usage time, ranks plugins, and persists enable or isolation decisions. Its API supports conflict review and plugin control, with a trial before restoring an isolated plugin. It requires DSH and Node.js 18 or later.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:7-8","lib/index.js:410-476","lib/priority.js:52-60"]}
